{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-809", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/809", "wordCount": 1467, "segments": [{"start": 22.0, "text": "Whether you're a designer or engineer, we all want our apps"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "to look and feel amazing."}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "We want our code to be flawless,"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "our assets to be pixel perfect,"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "and our store ratings to be five"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "stars nothing less."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "But let's talk about reality."}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "As a designer you're focused on"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "creating delightful interfaces"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "and experiences."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "As an engineer you're focused on"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "making sure you code works and"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "nothing breaks."}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "As a result the process becomes"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "slow and everyone feels"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "frustrated."}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "It's friction we don't need."}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "In the next 10 minutes we're"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "going to look at four things"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "that will really help make"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "difference."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "So let's get started."}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "The first is using the same"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "terminology."}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "This saves time, eliminates"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "confusion, and increases"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "credibility with your team and"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "clients."}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "Let's look at some examples of"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "how using different terms"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "amongst team members can create"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "confusion down the road."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "All right, pop quiz time."}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "By a show of hands, which of the"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "following is the right term for"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "this piece of UI -- Is it a"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "pop-up?"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "Popover? Modal?"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "Wow you guys are good."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "And the right answer is none of"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "The correct term is UI Alert"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "Controller or more currently"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "called an Alert."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "All right, another show of"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "hands."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "Which of the following is the"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "right term for this bar -- Is it"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "a Header?"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "Top Tool Bar?"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "Navigation Bar?"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "The actual term is Navigation"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "Bar."}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "All right and what do we call"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "this bar?"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "Is it a Drawer?"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "Tool Bar? Bottom Navigation Bar?"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "The right term is Tool Bar."}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "All right last one, show of"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "hands. Which of the following is the"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "right term for this control?"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "Is it a Switch?"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "Is it a Toggle?"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "Is it a On-Off Slider?"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "No? The actual term would be"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "Switch."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "So these are just some of the"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "elements that have been called"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "different things by different"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "people."}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "I am sure most of you have"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "experienced moments where you"}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "have had a performance stream of"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "mental translations when someone"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "asks you to implement a Toggle"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "and the modal trigger a pop-up."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "Adopting mutually understood"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "terminology is so important to"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "eliminating confusion and"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "frustration."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "It's like you said cup, when you"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "really meant this kind of cup."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "You want to agree on terminology"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "that doesn't require additional"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "brain cycles to interpret down"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "the road."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "So here are some quick"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "activities that you can try with"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "your team to reach that goal."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "Take 30 minutes with your team"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "or client to do an app"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "postmortem, just focusing on"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "terms."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "Make it fun, turn it into a"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "Pictionary game."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "Put things up on a whiteboard"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "and spend 20 seconds doing flash"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "reactions to it."}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "And for the more formal minded,"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "create a report showing all the"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "breakdowns due to terminology"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "confusion."}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "Developer to Apple.com is a"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "great resource for referencing"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "standard terminology whether in"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "the Human Interface Guidelines"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "or in the API Reference"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "Documentation."}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "All right, the second thing I"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "want to talk about is having one"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "source of truth."}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "Ever been in a situation where"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "you've had to pull mockups from"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "a server, stings from a Project"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "Wiki and then doing like a last"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "minute asset swap send via email"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "or coming back to an old project"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "and not knowing which is the"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "right version to open."}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "Hashtag designer life."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "What if you and your team or"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "client could agree before hand a"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "single place where all of the"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "approved deliverables can be"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "accessed."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "This would ensure that everyone"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "knows where to go to check out"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "the necessary assets."}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "Unfortunately designers don't"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "have similarly universal options"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "as engineers currently do with"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "their IDE's and Version Control."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "There's an increasing number of"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "solutions that have come in the"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "last few years."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "So work with your designers to"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "find one that integrates with"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "their tools and yours."}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "All right, thirdly I want to"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "talk about having very"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "thoughtful focus."}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "Let's be real."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "There's an inherent desire to"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "start customizing your UI so you"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "can stand out from your"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "competition."}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "But have you stopped to consider"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "the big picture first?"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "When designing and developing an"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "app, you're creating a system"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "and systems have a lot of"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "complexity where everything is"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "interrelated and interdependent."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "It requires all of us to think"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "deeply into all the use cases,"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "balancing that against your"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "time, skill, and other system"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "resource constraints."}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "It helps if you start from a"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "place of familiarity."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "Just as most of you are more"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "familiar with cooking using a"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "non-stick pan, rather than"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "something more specialized like"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "a tandoor oven, starting with"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "standard patterns and resources"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "you get for free in the SDK"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "helps to speed up the entire"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "process."}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "Here's an example of a standard"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "table."}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "Starting with a standard table"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "view with this accompanying"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "disclosure indicator accessory,"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "would free up time to work on"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "ensuring that the implementation"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "is stable."}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "This also ensures that the app"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "will work with accessibility"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "features in the OS, which is a"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "huge plus for many people."}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "Then when you want to start"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "creating Custom UI, you'll be in"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "a more empathetic state of mind"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "to ask is it worth the effort?"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "Here are some activities I want"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "you to do before going down any"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "path."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "Thoroughly consider all the"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "intended and etch use cases."}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "Write them down."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "Better yet do this together with"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "your team or client."}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "Find out what resources with the"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "OS or your tools that come for"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "free and leverage that as a"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "starting point and build"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "accessibility considerations up"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "front."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "This will ensure even more"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "people can enjoy your app."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "All right finally I want to talk"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "about show and tell."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "Or rather show more than tell."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "Designers can be guilty of"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "throwing static mockups inspects"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "over to engineers, especially in"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "a time crunch."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "Or engineers can blindly"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "implement the specs without"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "seeking clarification."}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "Then when the app is being"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "reviewed by the team, there's"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "invariably complaints from the"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "designer that implementation"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "didn't match the intent, or"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "frustration from the engineer"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "that the spec wasn't detailed"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "enough to fill in the mental"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "gaps."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "More often than not,"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "demonstrating with a video or a"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "small interactive prototype can"}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "be extremely valuable in"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "communicating the intent or"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "better yet, sparking a"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "conversation on constraints,"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "possible solutions, and next"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "steps."}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "Here's an example of an"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "animation spec for transitioning"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "into a full screen sketch on the"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "Notes app, the designer could be"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "delivering to an engineer."}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "Showing graphical"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "representations of the curves,"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "the related parameter value"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "pairs or better yet, the exact"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "API reference, coupled with a"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "video of the design animation"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "will ensure that the"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "implementation will certainly"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "match the intent."}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "Designers, you can do this."}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "There are powerful prototyping"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "tools out there like Principle,"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "Flinto, or even Apple Keynote"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "that are really easy to use, so"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "I highly encourage you to try"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "And if you want to gain extra"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "credit ability of the engineer,"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "try using Xcode."}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "See how engineers use it to"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "bring your designs to life."}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "Diving in doesn't even require"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "any coding."}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "You can open Xcode, select any"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "app option, track your assets"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "into the asset catalog to see"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "for example how your app icons"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "will be implemented."}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "Or try the storyboard feature to"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "create simple flows."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "Hint -- you can import your"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "static mockups in here to create"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "interactive prototypes."}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "Use the object liability to see"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "how built in controls work and"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "what they're really called."}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "And look at all these states and"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "properties for the table view"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "accessory that UI Kit is"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "providing for free."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "Using the same tool helps build"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "empathy, keeps you informed, and"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "thereby build credibility."}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "It can also initiate"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "conversations that can be"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "helpful to improving the app"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "that you're both working on."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "So here are some activities I"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "want you to try with your team."}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "Set short face-to-face times and"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "run through your prototypes with"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "each other."}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "Use that time to tweak values or"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "use the opportunity to explore"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "alternatives."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "And schedule feedback sessions"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "while you're in context."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "For example, grab your designer"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "or engineer teammate while your"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "project is still open and before"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "you're about to check in your"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "work."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "Quick timely communication"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "reduces errors and mitigates"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "potentially bad situations down"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "the road when your app is in"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "your users hands."}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "So in summary, here are the four"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "things to start working on --"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "agree on the same terminology,"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "decide on a single source where"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "everyone knows where to post and"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "check out deliverables, have a"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "thoughtful focus on use cases,"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "resource capabilities and"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "accessibility and demonstrating"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "with dynamic prototypes rather"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "than static screenshots."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "Doing these four things will"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "really help with infective"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "communication."}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "You'll get clarity on what needs"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "to be done and you'll gain"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "credibility with your team,"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "client, and users."}]}
